  "label": "User projected onto the visual material of the woman as an Auburn fan",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman (the 'provocative_glamour_scene') as a representative of an Auburn University fan. The meme uses the rhetorical setup 'whatever this is..' to imply that the viewer should recognize the visual as something associated with Auburn fans, thereby projecting the user's own identity or perspective onto the visual representation. The user is not explicitly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the rhetorical framing invites the user to identify with or interpret the visual as a symbol of Auburn fandom, making the user a participant in the meme's projection.",
